{"w":2400,"h":3395,"lines":[{"h":0.01453488398216074,"w":0.11316872914632159,"y":0.097383720785082395,"c":1,"x":0.12757201391860873,"t":"Audioscripts"},{"c":1,"x":0.12962962951202514,"w":0.045267489751180001,"t":"ANNIE:","y":0.14244186036598294,"h":0.0087209303892965551},{"x":0.12962962886528501,"w":0.039094651540120456,"h":0.008720930389296444,"t":"JACK:","y":0.18604651152531304,"c":1},{"t":"ANNIE:","w":0.047325102488199877,"x":0.12757201699149676,"y":0.21366279044783343,"c":1,"h":0.011627907185728592},{"y":0.2296511626881037,"c":1,"h":0.008720930389296444,"x":0.12962962886528501,"t":"JACK.","w":0.039094651540120456},{"h":0.011627907185728703,"c":1,"x":0.12757201674715521,"y":0.27180232540422866,"t":"ANNIE:","w":0.047325102488199877},{"x":0.12757201597528445,"t":"JACK:","y":0.31540697661036199,"w":0.041152264277140305,"h":0.010174418787512574,"c":1},{"w":0.039094651540120429,"t":"JACK:","x":0.12757201569656074,"h":0.010174418787512574,"y":0.35174418592681866,"c":1},{"h":0.010999119043069494,"x":0.12740094327726953,"c":1,"t":"ANNIE:","w":0.047667249043782556,"y":0.39493648696618211},{"c":1,"h":0.008720930389296444,"t":"JACK:","x":0.12962962885385379,"w":0.039094651540120456,"y":0.42441860454856883},{"h":0.008720930389296333,"x":0.12962962929127383,"y":0.43895348827295977,"t":"ANNIE:","w":0.043209877014160153,"c":1},{"x":0.12551440274338782,"t":"JACK:","y":0.45348837197481773,"w":0.041152264277140305,"h":0.010174418787512574,"c":1},{"h":0.010525403511397857,"t":"ANNIE:","x":0.12749419991468008,"c":1,"w":0.045423123041788721,"y":0.50999892607952102},{"c":1,"t":"JACK.","w":0.039094651540120429,"y":0.52616279059508042,"x":0.12757201569656074,"h":0.0087209303892965551},{"c":1,"y":0.53924418585896283,"t":"ANNIE:","h":0.011627907185728592,"w":0.047325102488199877,"x":0.1255144036206855},{"y":0.59738372082763858,"x":0.12757201591812853,"t":"JACK:","c":1,"h":0.008720930389296444,"w":0.041152264277140305},{"t":"ANNIE:","y":0.61191860453550739,"x":0.12757201634330084,"w":0.045267489751180029,"h":0.010174418787512463,"c":1},{"x":0.12551440295382529,"y":0.6555232556957481,"w":0.043209877014160153,"h":0.010174418787512574,"c":1,"t":"JACK:"},{"w":0.045396210352579763,"t":"ANNIE:","x":0.12750765603194794,"c":1,"h":0.010463902189256968,"y":0.68444828143743097},{"y":0.71366279059365545,"h":0.008720930389296444,"w":0.039094651540120456,"c":1,"t":"JACK:","x":0.12757201570294874},{"h":0.011377698541108816,"x":0.12732687676893767,"c":1,"t":"ANNIE:","w":0.047815383275349954,"y":0.72614254589566896},{"h":0.011627907185728592,"x":0.12551440317673335,"y":0.75581395328698053,"t":"JACK:","c":1,"w":0.043209877014160153},{"y":0.78469612661179966,"c":1,"t":"ANNIE:","h":0.010549607069107569,"w":0.045433673858642581,"x":0.12748892455759611},{"h":0.011627907185728592,"x":0.12551440459491994,"t":"JACK:","y":0.79941860443039148,"w":0.041152261098225923,"c":1},{"c":1,"t":"Exactly. At least there are now plenty of organisations that will recycle most of","x":0.22222222714244377,"w":0.57818929036458333,"h":0.011627907185728592,"y":0.14098837198645464},{"t":"the components safely, but of course some people just dump old fridges in the","w":0.58436213175455731,"x":0.2201646130284316,"h":0.011778563015312105,"c":1,"y":0.15547703170856764},{"c":1,"w":0.092592589060465497,"h":0.011627907185728703,"x":0.21810699801091951,"y":0.17005813933349223,"t":"countryside."},{"c":1,"w":0.58436213175455731,"h":0.013081395583944722,"y":0.18459302313594905,"t":"It's hard to see how they can be stopped unfortunately. In the UK we get rid of","x":0.21810699986382567},{"x":0.22016461224726924,"t":"three million a year altogether!","h":0.011778563015312105,"c":1,"y":0.19905771520170623,"w":0.22839505513509117},{"t":"That sounds a lot, especially because fridges hardly ever break down.","w":0.52263376871744793,"h":0.011627907185728703,"c":1,"x":0.22016459701243454,"y":0.21366279059070814},{"t":"That's right. In this country we keep domestic fridges for 11 years on average, and","x":0.22011301868147712,"c":1,"w":0.60297709147135414,"h":0.014571782978179293,"y":0.22664908838182063},{"w":0.59876541137695305,"h":0.013250883392226132,"t":"a lot last for 20 or more. So if you divide the cost by the number of years you can","x":0.22016461930670081,"y":0.24116607777429389,"c":1},{"t":"use a fridge, they're not expensive, compared with some household appliances.","x":0.21805747639368045,"h":0.014925883150493924,"w":0.58859278361002609,"y":0.25563307037974292,"c":1},{"w":0.60503067016601564,"x":0.22010904008649998,"t":"True. I suppose manufacturers encourage people to spend more by making them","y":0.27032261972137273,"h":0.013894633213398122,"c":1},{"w":0.59259256998697918,"y":0.28474676069631744,"h":0.01472320376914027,"x":0.21810700707391389,"t":"different colours and designs. I'm sure when my parents bought their first fridge","c":1},{"w":0.20987654368082684,"h":0.014534882858869613,"c":1,"y":0.29941860490050698,"x":0.21810699446617102,"t":"they had hardly any choice!"},{"y":0.31242638416993662,"h":0.014723203769140047,"c":1,"x":0.2201646068335765,"w":0.25308642069498699,"t":"Yes, there's been quite a change."},{"c":1,"t":"Right, let's make a list of topics to cover in our presentation, and decide who's","x":0.22222222714170092,"w":0.57818929036458333,"h":0.013081395583944611,"y":0.35029069755451214},{"x":0.22016460210297045,"c":1,"y":0.36482558127407883,"w":0.60082305908203115,"h":0.013081395583944611,"t":"going to do more research on them. Then later, we can get together and plan the"},{"h":0.013081395583944722,"c":1,"t":"OK. How about starting with how useful refrigeration is, and the range of goods","x":0.22016462025121938,"y":0.39389534871731957,"w":0.59259256998697918},{"x":0.22016462025048442,"y":0.408421672410195,"h":0.011778563015312105,"c":1,"t":"that are refrigerated nowadays? Because of course it's not just food and drinks.","w":0.59259256998697918},{"t":"No, I suppose flowers and medicines are refrigerated, too.","x":0.22016460203365096,"y":0.42285041238995791,"w":0.43415639241536452,"h":0.013250883392226132,"c":1},{"c":1,"h":0.013081395583944722,"y":0.43749999987949995,"t":"And computers. I could do that, unless you particularly want to.","x":0.2181070004886152,"w":0.4691357930501302},{"c":1,"t":"No, that's fine by me. What about the effects of refrigeration on people's health?","x":0.22010711772320746,"y":0.44964432441959334,"w":0.59477081298828127,"h":0.014400900042099041},{"w":0.60096298217773436,"t":"After all, some of the chemicals used in the 19th century were pretty harmful, but","h":0.01498708286891981,"c":1,"x":0.2200911865508427,"y":0.46391499484191012},{"c":1,"x":0.22016460298343568,"w":0.59465021769205728,"h":0.011627907185728592,"t":"there have been lots of benefits too, like always having access to fresh food. Do","y":0.48110465105625133},{"c":1,"t":"you fancy dealing with that?","w":0.21399177551269533,"x":0.21604937978480465,"y":0.49411071828453479,"h":0.01472320376914027},{"t":"I'm not terribly keen, to be honest.","x":0.22001597530676165,"w":0.25335606892903639,"h":0.014046147799183006,"y":0.50867207578039864,"c":1},{"w":0.53909464518229167,"t":"Nor me. My mind just goes blank when I read anything about chemicals.","x":0.22016461142142116,"h":0.013081395583944722,"y":0.52325581383241815,"c":1},{"y":0.53769140141062099,"h":0.013250883392226132,"c":1,"t":"Oh, all right then, I'll do you a favour. But you owe me, Jack.","x":0.22016460015285816,"w":0.44650207519531254},{"x":0.22016460486640047,"y":0.55232558127539044,"c":1,"t":"OK. What about the effects on food producers, like farmers in poorer countries","w":0.58230453491210943,"h":0.013081395583944722},{"x":0.22016460499131218,"c":1,"w":0.58230453491210932,"y":0.56684334490649424,"t":"being able to export their produce to developed countries? Something for you,","h":0.013098515666696509},{"y":0.59310453606861291,"h":0.016067172388586681,"x":0.21796551609790116,"w":0.31723581949869784,"c":1,"t":"I don't mind. It should be quite interesting."},{"t":"I think we should also look at how refrigeration has helped whole cities - like Las","x":0.21802225201309075,"y":0.60767698768414768,"w":0.60100479125976558,"h":0.015928713255973226,"c":1},{"y":0.62499999989339361,"h":0.011631330977620702,"t":"Vegas, which couldn't exist without refrigeration because it's in the middle of a","c":1,"x":0.22016459670329122,"w":0.58024693806966143},{"x":0.22016460936717186,"h":0.010174418787512574,"c":1,"t":"desert.","y":0.6395348836073812,"w":0.049382715225219698},{"y":0.65400471135781457,"h":0.011778563015312216,"w":0.59259256998697918,"c":1,"t":"Right. I had a quick look at an economics book in the library that's got a chapter","x":0.22016462025084271},{"h":0.013081395583944722,"w":0.58024693806966143,"x":0.21810698353444744,"y":0.66860465104275002,"t":"about this sort of thing.I could give you the title, if you want to do this section.","c":1},{"c":1,"w":0.57624664306640627,"h":0.014499191401001976,"t":"Not particularly, to be honest. I find economics books pretty heavy going, as a","y":0.68184034035281793,"x":0.22010634713682606},{"y":0.69549399188640637,"x":0.21695473405427776,"w":0.040205758412679066,"h":0.014622481607857285,"c":1,"t":"rule."},{"t":"OK, leave it to me, then.","x":0.21793379854927381,"w":0.18349548339843752,"y":0.71086129145923138,"c":1,"h":0.01451674395090552},{"t":"Thanks. Then there's transport, and the difference that refrigerated trucks have","x":0.22016462111335461,"w":0.5864197285970052,"h":0.013250883392226132,"y":0.72526501742741933,"c":1},{"x":0.21810699045340262,"t":"made. wouldn't mind having a go at that.","h":0.011778563015312105,"w":0.31275721232096354,"y":0.74116607778654908,"c":1},{"y":0.754360464995669,"c":1,"t":"Don't forget trains, too. I read something about milk and butter being transported","w":0.59670781453450528,"x":0.22016461112723221,"h":0.013081395583944611},{"c":1,"h":0.014723203769140158,"y":0.76884570090949877,"t":"in refrigerated railroad cars in the USA, right back in the 1840s.","x":0.21604938645542765,"w":0.47530863444010413},{"h":0.013095091313158891,"t":"I hadn't thought of trains. Thanks.","c":1,"x":0.21810699075556556,"w":0.25514404296874998,"y":0.78343023243150145},{"c":1,"t":"Shall we have a separate section on domestic fridges? After all, they're","y":0.79655901186789513,"w":0.52688034057617195,"h":0.014690244717367684,"x":0.22009808477248252},{"t":"something everyone's familiar with.","x":0.22001221777864885,"y":0.81167535022231641,"w":0.26160034179687497,"h":0.014964155931776024,"c":1},{"t":"116","w":0.03497942288716635,"c":1,"x":0.12757201685502792,"h":0.013081395583944722,"y":0.91424418588807843},{"x":0.85596707859071031,"h":0.011627907185728592,"w":0.034979422887166267,"t":"Q23","c":1,"y":0.15552325567070158},{"w":0.034979422887166267,"c":1,"y":0.24127906951907419,"x":0.85596707882390666,"h":0.013081395583944722,"t":"Q24"},{"w":0.034979422887166378,"x":0.85596707858342291,"t":"Q25","h":0.011627907185728703,"c":1,"y":0.39389534869637988},{"x":0.85596707858342291,"c":1,"t":"Q26","y":0.45203488358010091,"w":0.034979422887166378,"h":0.011627907185728592},{"x":0.85596707857699283,"w":0.034979422887166267,"h":0.011627907185728592,"c":1,"y":0.53924418590781964,"t":"Q27"},{"y":0.61046511613824039,"h":0.011627907185728592,"w":0.034979422887166378,"c":1,"t":"Q28","x":0.85596707858342291},{"y":0.72674418590568213,"h":0.011627907185728592,"x":0.85596707858342291,"c":1,"t":"Q29","w":0.034979422887166378},{"h":0.013081395583944722,"x":0.85596707864558008,"t":"Q30","y":0.79796511608884169,"c":1,"w":0.034979422887166378}]}